/example/ShippingPolicyTest.java","request":"Calcola la spedizione in centesimi: per un subtotale non negativo inferiore a\n5.000 centesimi costa 500 centesimi; da 5.000 centesimi inclusi \u00e8 gratuita.\nRifiuta i subtotali negativi con IllegalArgumentException.","revision":{"dirty":null,"head":null,"working_tree":"UNVERSIONED"},"schema":"mom.operator.offline-handoff/v1","snapshot":{"README.md":{"sha256":"4c785563346535587a02dc8876908c4929a6895e0aef7a70b2c020ba2399ec44","text":"# MOM-E2E-001: shipping threshold\n\nNew public, disposable Java fixture, independent of the historical payment\nfixtures. No libraries, build framework, services or credentials are required.\nThe production source deliberately retains one deterministic logic bug.\n\n## User request\n\nCalcola la spedizione in centesimi: per un subtotale non negativo inferiore a\n5.000 centesimi costa 500 centesimi; da 5.000 centesimi inclusi \u00e8 gratuita.\nRifiuta i subtotali negativi con IllegalArgumentException.\n\n## Acceptance oracle (defined before the baseline test)\n\n| Input subtotal (cents) | Expected |\n|---|---|\n| 4,999 | shipping 500 |\n| 5,000 | shipping 0 (regression) |\n| 5,001 | shipping 0 |\n| -1 | IllegalArgumentException |\n\nThe test and this oracle are fixed criteria for the subsequent mission. Do not\nedit them to accommodate a repair. The anticipated repair scope is the single\nproduction file `src/main/java/example/ShippingPolicy.java`; no repair is made\nin the baseline task.\n\n## Run without dependencies\n\nFrom this fixture directory, choose a new dedicated external output directory:\n\n```sh\nOUT=$(mktemp -d /private/tmp/mom-e2e-001-test.XXXXXX)\nmkdir \"$OUT/classes\"\njavac -d \"$OUT/classes\" src/main/java/example/ShippingPolicy.java src/test/java/example/ShippingPolicyTest.java\njava -cp \"$OUT/classes\" example.ShippingPolicyTest\n```\n\nCompilation must succeed. The unchanged baseline test must exit nonzero solely\nfor the 5,000-cent case and print all four case results. A later accepted repair\nmust pass this identical test with exit 0. These are Codex/test-harness commands;\nrunning them directly does not qualify MOM/MANA execution.\n"},"src/main/java/example/ShippingPolicy.java":{"sha256":"6cf6343bfca268bdb0aff9be60894170a51e9919cca1ef828e0a2b09136998ee","text":"package example;\n\npublic final class ShippingPolicy {\n    private ShippingPolicy() {}\n\n    public static int shippingCents(int subtotalCents) {\n        if (subtotalCents < 0) {\n            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"Subtotal must be nonnegative\");\n        }\n        return subtotalCents > 5000 ? 0 : 500;\n    }\n}\n"},"src/test/java/example/ShippingPolicyTest.java":{"sha256":"ae4668670b8814c7525bf66693ca3707938e3ddf18ec95cdf8c69a49195a883e","text":"package example;\n\npublic final class ShippingPolicyTest {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int failures = 0;\n        failures += check(4999, 500);\n        failures += check(5000, 0);\n        failures += check(5001, 0);\n        try {\n            ShippingPolicy.shippingCents(-1);\n            System.out.println(\"FAIL input=-1 expected=IllegalArgumentException observed=no-exception\");\n            failures++;\n        } catch (IllegalArgumentException expected) {\n            System.out.println(\"PASS input=-1 expected=IllegalArgumentException observed=IllegalArgumentException\");\n        }\n        if (failures != 0) {\n            throw new AssertionError(\"Failed cases: \" + failures);\n        }\n        System.out.println(\"PASS all 4 cases\");\n    }\n\n    private static int check(int input, int expected) {\n        int observed = ShippingPolicy.shippingCents(input);\n        boolean passed = observed == expected;\n        System.out.println((passed ? \"PASS\" : \"FAIL\") + \" input=\" + input\n                + \" expected=\" + expected + \" observed=\" + observed);\n        return passed ? 0 : 1;\n    }\n}\n"}},"snapshot_sha256":"130cb27f773699fdc5bf5065dc20544f224a6b4dce6c99930405a7eaf929669d"},"open_blocks":["MANA application/test contract","Native isolation","Effective host authorization","Enforced provider limits","MANA revision mismatch"],"rationale":{"evidence_ids":["8816201d785e6cf56ea4386ee4b7b16b","ea85895863c5a876327a32c3b779131a"],"explanation":"MOM observes shippingCents at lines 6-11 (syntax only). The frozen baseline receipt records 5000 -> 500 instead of 0. Codex proposes an inclusive comparison; behavior remains untested."},"requested_effects":["Future modification of the single source; no effect authorized now"],"schema":"mom.operator.offline-proposal/v1","status":"HUMAN_REQUIRED","test_plan":["FUTURE ONLY, after separate native authority and isolation qualification:","Compile src/main/java/example/ShippingPolicy.java and frozen src/test/java/example/ShippingPolicyTest.java in a dedicated external build directory.","Run example.ShippingPolicyTest; require all four unchanged cases and exit 0.","Compare exact applied diff/base fingerprint and frozen test SHA-256 before acceptance."]},"protected_files":["/Users/zel/projects/mana-o-matic/tests/fixtures/mom-e2e-001/README.md","/Users/zel/projects/mana-o-matic/tests/fixtures/mom-e2e-001/src/main/java/example/ShippingPolicy.java","/Users/zel/projects/mana-o-matic/tests/fixtures/mom-e2e-001/src/test/java/example/ShippingPolicyTest.java","/Users/zel/projects/mana-o-matic/AGENTS.md","/Users/zel/projects/mana-o-matic/config/mana-reference.json","/Users/zel/projects/mana/config/divination-domains.tsv"],"provider":"none","result_sha256":"acdfdd17d5d53bad3e7abdfc59a43ff07da4158060899a19f28e2859e1ce1cc2","runtime":{"base_revision":"aaed1122a22a9c1dc3f88771b2527180d967fb4f","changes_identity":"abb7b77bf58b87fe6b49a262a8893e6a1b7403f96461549a297fe9094a471d5a","files":{"scripts/lib/exact_repair.py":"82d51900c7fade715f8a71acacd398aaa4793bedc40c9e781a44c9f4cdc25f7e","scripts/lib/verification-exec.pl":"9cb5bd9642d269adf857ba10ab3ad9c91e44307dc0a8d820fbfaa62557989f1a","scripts/mana-r